{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 77,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        115.84590148925781,
        27.289522171020508,
        337.6759338378906,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "8. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON TREATMENT OF FEVER CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.173309326171875,
        263.0199279785156,
        73.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "8.6\t Antibiotic treatment for Typhoid Fever",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        76.79890441894531,
        399.1029052734375,
        90.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Children with typhoid fever should be treated with a fluoroquinolone (i.e.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        89.79890441894531,
        399.0714111328125,
        103.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "ciprofloxacin, gatifloxacin, ofloxacin, and perfloxacin) as a first line treatment for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        102.79890441894531,
        111.45149993896484,
        116.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "7–10 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        115.79890441894531,
        345.99151611328125,
        129.28890991210938
      ],
      "text": "—\t Ciprofloxacin: orally 15 mg/kg per dose twice daily for 7–10 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        131.20361328125,
        277.6928405761719,
        145.12362670898438
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation; moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        147.4682159423828,
        399.12286376953125,
        160.95822143554688
      ],
      "text": "b)\tIf the response to treatment is poor, consider drug-resistant typhoid and treat with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        160.4682159423828,
        373.4715881347656,
        173.95822143554688
      ],
      "text": "a second line antibiotic like 3rd generation cephalosporins or azithromycin.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        173.4682159423828,
        268.2615966796875,
        186.95822143554688
      ],
      "text": "—\t Cetriaxone IV: 80 mg/kg per day for 5–7 days",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        186.4682159423828,
        81.58150482177734,
        199.95822143554688
      ],
      "text": "OR",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        199.4682159423828,
        265.421630859375,
        212.95822143554688
      ],
      "text": "—\t Azithromycin: 20 mg/kg per day for 5–7 days",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        214.87289428710938,
        277.7628173828125,
        228.79290771484375
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        231.1374969482422,
        399.0528869628906,
        244.62750244140625
      ],
      "text": "c)\t Where drug resistance to antibiotics among salmonella isolates is known, follow",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        244.1374969482422,
        313.4814147949219,
        257.62750244140625
      ],
      "text": "the national guidelines according to local susceptibility data.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        259.5420837402344,
        277.7628173828125,
        273.46209716796875
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        275.8067932128906,
        399.0529479980469,
        289.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "The panel noted that patterns of antimicrobial resistance to salmonella isolates are",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        288.8067932128906,
        399.0130310058594,
        302.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "constantly changing, making continuous surveillance of resistance levels critical for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        301.8067932128906,
        399.1329650878906,
        315.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "clinicians to keep abreast of treatment options. Currently, nalidixic acid resistance",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        314.8067932128906,
        399.0928955078125,
        328.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "is very common and widespread across many countries and there is increasing",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        327.8067932128906,
        399.0229797363281,
        341.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "resistance to ciprofloxacin. This trend in antibiotic resistance to fluoroquinolones",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        340.8067932128906,
        399.1429443359375,
        354.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "may have implications on the effectiveness of ciprofloxacin in some countries, which",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        353.8067932128906,
        399.06280517578125,
        367.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "may require use of alternative fluoroquinolone determined by local susceptibility",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        366.8067932128906,
        76.53290557861328,
        380.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "data.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        379.8067932128906,
        399.11138916015625,
        393.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "It was also noted that the duration of treatment varied from 7 to15 days in the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        392.8067932128906,
        399.0329895019531,
        406.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "RCTs studies that were reviewed making it difficult to draw a conclusive decision",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        405.8067932128906,
        399.06292724609375,
        419.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "about duration. However, it was clear that treatment required at least ≥ 7 days of first",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        418.8067932128906,
        119.16291809082031,
        432.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "line antibiotics.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        443.3254089355469,
        233.98292541503906,
        455.3153991699219
      ],
      "text": "8.6.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        458.97998046875,
        399.0928649902344,
        472.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "First line antibiotics, including beta-lactams and chloramphenicol, have gradually",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        471.97998046875,
        399.07281494140625,
        485.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "become less useful with increasing drug resistance. Studies of antibiotic resistance",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        484.97998046875,
        399.0628356933594,
        498.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "since 1989 in the Indian subcontinent and China have shown that 50–80% of all",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        497.97998046875,
        399.1028137207031,
        511.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "Salmonella typhi isolates were multidrug resistant (MDR) [Lee 2000]. The choice",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        510.97998046875,
        399.0929870605469,
        524.469970703125
      ],
      "text": "of antibiotics for enteric fever has been based on studies of the prevalence of MDR",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        523.8499755859375,
        185.0233917236328,
        537.469970703125
      ],
      "text": "Salmonella typhi paratyphi  and  .",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        536.97998046875,
        399.0613708496094,
        550.469970703125
      ],
      "text": "A Cochrane review evaluated fluoroquinolone antibiotics for treating enteric fever",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        549.97998046875,
        399.1228332519531,
        563.469970703125
      ],
      "text": "in children and adults compared with other antibiotics, different fluoroquinolones,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        562.97998046875,
        399.1029052734375,
        576.469970703125
      ],
      "text": "and different durations of fluoroquinolone treatment [Thaver, 2008]. The review",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        575.9801025390625,
        399.0929870605469,
        589.4700927734375
      ],
      "text": "included 38 trials; 22 had unclear allocation concealment and 34 did not use",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        588.9801025390625,
        399.0729064941406,
        602.4700927734375
      ],
      "text": "blinding. Only four trials exclusively included children, seven had both adults and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        601.9801025390625,
        399.07293701171875,
        615.4700927734375
      ],
      "text": "children, and three studied outpatients. There are no conclusive data to make firm",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        614.9801025390625,
        399.1429748535156,
        628.4700927734375
      ],
      "text": "recommendations regarding the superiority of fluoroquinolones over first line",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.3583984375,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.6833953857422,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "63",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}